{"id":"f4625243fc1dd8f0","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-epsilon-reachability.md","title":"Epsilon Closure","display":"df-epsilon-closure — Epsilon Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-epsilon-reachability","aliases":["73-df-epsilon-reachability","73-df-epsilon-closure"],"display":"df-epsilon-closure — Epsilon Closure","depends_on":["[[73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§2.5, print pp. 68–78; PDF pp. 90–100; local typed epsilon label","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§2.4, pp. 24–28; local typed epsilon labels and closure functions","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":2},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-epsilon-reachability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-epsilon-reachability</span><span>73-df-epsilon-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-epsilon-closure — Epsilon Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"554f551d165cef7f\" href=\"?note=554f551d165cef7f\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure\">73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§2.5, print pp. 68–78; PDF pp. 90–100; local typed epsilon label"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§2.4, pp. 24–28; local typed epsilon labels and closure functions"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"554f551d165cef7f\" href=\"?note=554f551d165cef7f\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure\">73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq Q\">\\(S\\subseteq Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in Q\">\\(q\\in Q\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RTC}_Q\">\\(\\operatorname{RTC}_Q\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EClos}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{EClos}_M\\)</span> 保留两个类型重载：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(Q)\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\">\\(\\mathcal P(Q)\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\">\\(Q\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\\)</span>。下式的函数类型标注属于形式调用的一部分；省略标注时由已声明参数类型确定，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\cap\\mathcal P(Q)=\\varnothing\">\\(Q\\cap\\mathcal P(Q)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nE_M\\coloneqq\\{(p,r)\\in Q^2:r\\in\\delta(p,\\varepsilon)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nE_M\\coloneqq\\{(p,r)\\in Q^2:r\\in\\delta(p,\\varepsilon)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n(\\operatorname{EClos}_M:\\mathcal P(Q)\\to\\mathcal P(Q))(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{r\\in Q:\\exists p\\in S\\;((p,r)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_Q(E_M))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n(\\operatorname{EClos}_M:\\mathcal P(Q)\\to\\mathcal P(Q))(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{r\\in Q:\\exists p\\in S\\;((p,r)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_Q(E_M))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n(\\operatorname{EClos}_M:Q\\to\\mathcal P(Q))(q)\\coloneqq\n(\\operatorname{EClos}_M:\\mathcal P(Q)\\to\\mathcal P(Q))(\\{q\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n(\\operatorname{EClos}_M:Q\\to\\mathcal P(Q))(q)\\coloneqq\n(\\operatorname{EClos}_M:\\mathcal P(Q)\\to\\mathcal P(Q))(\\{q\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一状态可以恰好是一个集合，故不能靠底层集合形状判定调用哪个重载。两种原调用名及其数学含义均保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"554f551d165cef7f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure","status":"resolved","id":"554f551d165cef7f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}$，见 [[73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure]]；$S\\subseteq Q$、$q\\in Q$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RTC}_Q$ 见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq Q","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RTC}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EClos}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(Q)\\to\\mathcal P(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\to\\mathcal P(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\cap\\mathcal P(Q)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nE_M\\coloneqq\\{(p,r)\\in Q^2:r\\in\\delta(p,\\varepsilon)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n(\\operatorname{EClos}_M:\\mathcal P(Q)\\to\\mathcal P(Q))(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{r\\in Q:\\exists p\\in S\\;((p,r)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_Q(E_M))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n(\\operatorname{EClos}_M:Q\\to\\mathcal P